  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d6ceaeaf-7e8f-428a-b1c7-ce4e48a98ae0",
    "name": "CoffeeNChill - Part 1 (Tables & Blobs)",
    "description": "CLDV6212 Part 1 test suite.\n\nAligned to the implemented API: menu entities use PartitionKey (category) and RowKey (SKU); list endpoints return bare arrays.\n\nPer the POE addendum, staff documents are stored in Azure Blob Storage rather than an Azure File Share, because Azurite does not emulate the Files service.\n\nSetup:\n1. Import this collection and the environment.\n2. Select the CoffeeNChill - Local (Azurite) environment.\n3. Attach a file to Documents > Upload Staff Document.\n4. Collection > Run.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "58159986",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/58159986-d6ceaeaf-7e8f-428a-b1c7-ce4e48a98ae0?source=collection_link"
  },
